    "updated_at": "2021-12-21T07:23:27Z",
    "body": "Unfortunately, it doesn't actually set a HTTP header. That was the envisioned functionality, but it doesn't work like that in practice. That's why there are limitations.\r\n\r\nNot sure what you mean with \"just three\" by the way, there's seven pragma directives defined by the standard and five of them are currently conforming.",
